{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>手機中積累了成千上萬張照片，但真正值得保留的回憶往往被淹沒在重複的連拍與截圖裡。Picmori: Gallery Cleaner 是一款以直覺滑動操作為核心的相片清理工具，讓你像瀏覽社交媒體一樣快速篩選照片，向右保留、向左刪除，在重溫每一張影像的同時釋放儲存空間。目前這款 App 正在進行終生版內購限時免費活動，錯過不再。</p>\n\n<h2>直覺滑動與智能分組</h2>\n<p>Picmori 最大的特點是將清理過程變成一種回憶旅程。它會自動偵測相似照片與重複項目並分組顯示，你只需從每組連拍或截圖中挑選最喜歡的一張，其餘的可以一次過向左滑走。整個過程完全離線進行，所有照片只在裝置端處理，確保隱私安全。此外，工作階段統計功能會追蹤你檢視、保留與刪除的數量，讓你清楚看見相簿越變越輕盈。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-89-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-90-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-91-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-92-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-93-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1284x2778bb-94-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Picmori: Gallery Cleaner 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4333\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_4333-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4334\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_4334-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Picmori: Gallery Cleaner</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-10T10:59:11.870570+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":507,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}